msgid ""
"Disallow taps or keyboard presses being sent to the UI elements before they "
"are showing up.\n"
"E-ink screens are slow and take noticeable time to update the content. Users "
"may feel laggy, tap the screen or press the keyboard multiple times, and "
"cause the following actions to interact with the unshown UI elements and "
"trigger unexpected actions.\n"
"This feature decides if a user action is expected or caused by the delay of "
"screen refreshing, and drops the unexpected ones.\n"
